WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.597
Tina: Really, Bello? You're willing to come to my world?

2
00:00:04.598 --> 00:00:06.281
Bello: Of course I am.

3
00:00:06.282 --> 00:00:09.470
I was just a little boy when you came to my

4
00:00:09.471 --> 00:00:14.851
world. But I have always remembered how you helped me and my father.

5
00:00:14.852 --> 00:00:18.395
Tina: You were just like my baby brother─only bigger.I

6
00:00:18.396 --> 00:00:22.333
had fun looking after you. Danny did too. Bello: Yes,

7
00:00:22.334 --> 00:00:24.641
we had a lot of fun. And

8
00:00:24.642 --> 00:00:27.386
now it is my turn to help Danny. Tina:

9
00:00:27.387 --> 00:00:30.453
I hope he will listen to you, Bello. Hopian:

10
00:00:30.454 --> 00:00:36.493
Danny might be acting mean now, but he's a good boy, really. Bello

11
00:00:36.494 --> 00:00:41.837
will remind him of all the good he did for Ginormous. He'll

12
00:00:41.838 --> 00:00:44.934
want to be good again. Bello: I'll

13
00:00:44.935 --> 00:00:46.715
do my best. I'm looking

14
00:00:46.716 --> 00:00:49.893
forward to seeing your world, Tina. Hopian: Ever

15
00:00:49.894 --> 00:00:57.796
since his short visit as a baby, Bello has wanted to see your world again. Bello:

16
00:00:57.797 --> 00:01:00.302
It will be strange and wonderful. Everything

17
00:01:00.303 --> 00:01:04.173
will seem so small this time! Hopian:

18
00:01:04.174 --> 00:01:10.227
Bello, you must remember to be very careful. Bello:

19
00:01:10.228 --> 00:01:14.404
Sometimes my dad still thinks I'm a little kid.

20
00:01:14.405 --> 00:01:16.230
Tina: Don't worry, Hopian.

21
00:01:16.231 --> 00:01:22.316
I'm a good babysitter.

22
00:01:22.318 --> 00:01:26.153
Bello: Tina, you haven't told us how you traveled to our world.

23
00:01:26.154 --> 00:01:28.485
Tina: I used my imagination.

24
00:01:28.486 --> 00:01:32.564
Like your dad told us, imagination is the key.

25
00:01:32.565 --> 00:01:36.322
Hopian: How did you use your imagination,

26
00:01:36.323 --> 00:01:38.524
Tina? Tina: I had to concentrate

27
00:01:38.525 --> 00:01:40.588
hard. That was

28
00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:42.453
important. Hopian: What

29
00:01:42.454 --> 00:01:45.567
else? Tina: I knew that I wasn't good at art like

30
00:01:45.568 --> 00:01:48.981
Danny. So I concentrated on something that I like to do.

31
00:01:48.982 --> 00:01:51.479
Something I am good at.

32
00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:53.375
Bello: And what was that?

33
00:01:53.376 --> 00:01:56.576
Tina: Running! I ran as fast as the wind.

34
00:01:56.577 --> 00:02:00.771
There was a big storm, and a bolt of lightning almost hit me. But

35
00:02:00.772 --> 00:02:03.254
I kept running and jumping. I kept

36
00:02:03.255 --> 00:02:06.489
believing that I could reach you. And

37
00:02:06.490 --> 00:02:09.777
here I am! Hopian: And

38
00:02:09.778 --> 00:02:15.282
how do you and Bello plan to get back to your world? Tina: I

39
00:02:15.283 --> 00:02:17.638
hadn't thought that far ahead. Do you

40
00:02:17.639 --> 00:02:20.179
have any ideas, Hopian? Hopian: Perhaps.

41
00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:29.454
Let's go into the backyard. Tina:

42
00:02:29.455 --> 00:02:33.853
Gosh, I remember when we fought the dragonfly here. The

43
00:02:33.854 --> 00:02:36.167
garden was all gray then. Hopian: It

44
00:02:36.168 --> 00:02:39.664
looks better now, doesn't it? Tina: It's

45
00:02:39.665 --> 00:02:42.532
gorgeous. Bello: It

46
00:02:42.533 --> 00:02:46.327
looks better thanks to you, Danny, and Brad. Hopian:

47
00:02:46.328 --> 00:02:49.259
Look at the sky, Tina. Tina:

48
00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:51.829
That blue is incredible. And

49
00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:54.955
the sun is so yellow. Hopian:

50
00:02:54.956 --> 00:03:05.061
Look over there, past the trees and above the mountain. Tina:

51
00:03:05.062 --> 00:03:07.718
But . . . but that's impossible! Rainbows

52
00:03:07.719 --> 00:03:10.863
occur only after it rains!

53
00:03:10.865 --> 00:03:16.568
Hopian: The rainbow has never faded after all these years.

54
00:03:16.569 --> 00:03:25.236
It has stayed the same since the day you and your friends left. Tina:

55
00:03:25.237 --> 00:03:27.302
But . . . how? Hopian:

56
00:03:27.303 --> 00:03:31.008
It's a magical rainbow. Tina:

57
00:03:31.009 --> 00:03:36.186
And Bello and I can use the rainbow to travel back to my world?

58
00:03:36.187 --> 00:03:44.480
Hopian: I knew you would figure it out!

